// goban's forest view: from the debug panel (H), "Forest view" at (38, 387) and its "depths" at (248, 387); then the
// panel closed (H again) - the view stays on. Black's chain of four and three white stones, then the pointer rests
// on black's first stone: its walk up to the root is drawn over the other arrows. A mouse (one hover first).
// `zig build goban-headless -Dscript=examples/goban/check_forest.script`. The main menu's Start Game is at
// (443, 586); on 13 x 13 point (row, col) is at (114 + 56 col, 114 + 56 row).
.{ .advance = 3 }
.{ .move = .{ .x = 20, .y = 20 } }
.{ .advance = 1 }
.{ .move = .{ .x = 443, .y = 586 } }
.{ .press = .left }
.{ .advance = 1 }
.{ .release = .left }
.{ .advance = 2 }
.{ .key_down = .h }
.{ .advance = 1 }
.{ .key_up = .h }
.{ .advance = 2 }
.{ .move = .{ .x = 38, .y = 387 } }
.{ .press = .left }
.{ .advance = 1 }
.{ .release = .left }
.{ .advance = 2 }
